<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-12T13:00:27.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:00:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups attacked police in northwest Pakistan, killing ten officers and 18 fighters, and ambushed police in another incident with similar casualties. Security forces also faced lethal attacks in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, with eleven police feared dead in one clash and twelve injured in a separate incident in Kohat. Efforts are underway to reopen borders for trade, while a team reviewing alleged war crimes in Afghanistan reported missing key photographic evidence. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPaF9TNWZvLVZkYWRRcGZoU252cFBBUUtsM3dkdE9LSHBkVUh5UFRhUnEyaEdHa21tbmU5SkZRWGhhQmNsTGtBOWM3UnlsVUpLYm5PZFFVdDZ6a09KTFA5MlB4WWRRS3FxSm5uQXA3amEwX2c1bzZ1ZlZTSjlZTnNBUHYxNk9USFVTbXZtcF92YTdCWmFpMjI4VFdvZW94bGI5eDRtY2hjVVN3QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE4tRkVPS2g4dVlRYURRZ2x6YmZTNEVqOTBqNVc0Nk1UQk1kN1BpWXZiQmRETlN2UUxwckZLQmxad0JQR0F1R3VDTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOTGVJM3dIVThPbkNqYXlOYzFhVEIxd1ZidEVWNjZwSzJHM3o0WndJcHlNMHRyVGRKbVVNTHlTMWZ2VWE5Zm9sY2dPS1IxcXh6WEl5bl9LRk1nNWpKTlZlLU9kLXIxMW81d1Byc2VFQXU1RVNYaldaR2hhQlg3ZGE4a3JueEVxN282bkRFU0d6ZHBJcVhLMTI3dkN0ZDU5MlZlMDlYaVVoLW9CMHlyY2FFbTNKdHlDXzhvajJ0TVFQV3FzOUd0NjJOVURJMGY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQLUlPajFoQ0JJek9uOW5KdHMyV2tZT3I4V1FNTWtlcXpqR2JFMVBHNkRPc21yNmdWVHNPbXlZVDVZTnF2RTJSYkE3RUE5ZkNYWDdlaGR0WkcwbGJMSjhLYThJcnZvX25QcnlVb2llSTBKbWdyZkdnQUhfX09taGptZEstTnlsTjNSV0JRVS1YbWNVOHJHWlhoXy14eGRnNDRzdnFYaWg5YUhEOEllSGM3cXdOZEs?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&g